{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/extras/Iron_Rift.png?t=1742036058\" />The world was never the same after the Rift. One night, an explosion of unknown energy tore through reality, unleashing terrifying and powerful creatures into the world which are now called <strong>Ryzarks</strong>. Cities fell, chaos reigned, and humanity struggled to survive. To fight back, scientists developed Riftguns, weapons capable of capturing and digitizing these creatures for control. While some used them to restore balance, others saw an opportunity for power.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Among the lawless survivors is Lenz, a battle-hardened fighter with nothing to lose. Once a street criminal, now a survivor in a world ruled by monsters and warlords, Lenz doesn\u2019t care about justice\u2014only survival. But after he crosses paths with one of the unknown creatures and forms an uneasy alliance, he\u2019s dragged into a brutal war against the Ruthless 8\u2014a group of warlords who control powerful creatures and rule their territories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/extras/Action_Combat.png?t=1742036058\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control in adrenaline-pumping real-time battles! Call your Ryzark, unleash powerful abilities, and execute dynamic moves in the heat of action. With a perfect blend of strategy and skill, every encounter is a fierce test of your reflexes and tactics. Get ready for the thrill of non-stop action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/extras/Iron_Rift_Real_Time_Combat_1_GIF.gif?t=1742036058\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/extras/Iron_Rift_Real_Time_Combat_2_GIF.gif?t=1742036058\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/extras/World.png?t=1742036058\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/extras/Iron_Rift_World_1_GIF.gif?t=1742036058\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/extras/Iron_Rift_World_2_GIF.gif?t=1742036058\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two years ago, the world changed forever. A blinding rift tore through reality, unleashing powerful and violent creatures known as <strong>Ryzarks, </strong>bringing destruction wherever they roamed. Humanity had no choice but to adapt. Specialized <strong>Riftguns</strong> were developed to weaken and digitize Ryzark. While meant for survival and balance, this technology soon fell into the wrong hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Criminals hidden in the underground started gaining even more power by using Ryzarks to establish brutal territories. The most feared among them became known as the <strong>Ruthless 8</strong>, a group with deep connections and overwhelming strength, nearly untouchable even by the government.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lenz, a lone drifter hardened by a life of loss and violence, never cared for the world's problems\u2014until the chaos became personal. Now, with nothing left to lose, he steps into the fight. Whether for survival, revenge, or something more, one thing is certain: <strong>only those who master the Rift will control the future.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/extras/Equipment.png?t=1742036058\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/extras/Riftgun.png?t=1742036058\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Riftguns</strong> aren\u2019t traditional weapons; they won\u2019t kill a Ryzark. Instead, they\u2019re designed to <strong>weaken and digitize</strong> them, making it possible to store them for later use. Different classes of Riftguns exist, from basic models barely strong enough to subdue a wild Ryzark to high-powered versions capable of handling the most dangerous creatures. But no matter how strong your gun is, <strong>you won\u2019t truly defeat a Ryzark until you battle it with one of your own!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/extras/Iron_Rift_Riftgun_1_GIF.gif?t=1742036058\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/extras/Iron_Rift_Riftgun_2_GIF.gif?t=1742036058\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/extras/Arkvice.png?t=1742036058\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once digitized, a Ryzark is stored in the <strong>Arkvice</strong>, a high-tech device that lets you <strong>manage, call, and upgrade</strong> your creatures. The Arkvice tracks their stats, strengths, and weaknesses, and even allows for enhancements to make them stronger in battle.<br><br>The Rift changed the world\u2014now it\u2019s time to take control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/extras/Iron_Rift_Arkvice_1_GIF.gif?t=1742036058\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/extras/Iron_Rift_Arkvice_2_GIF.gif?t=1742036058\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/extras/Erase_System.png?t=1742036058\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When a Ryzark takes too much damage in battle, the creature's essence begins to fragment, breaking apart at a molecular level. This irreversible process is known as <strong>Erasure</strong>, and once it begins, there is no saving the Ryzark. Unlike digitization, which preserves and stores a Ryzark's form, Erasure destroys it, wiping its existence from reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some believe the Erase System is a natural safeguard, preventing the world from being overrun by Ryzarks. Others whisper that it's a side effect of the rift energy that brought them into existence. Whatever the truth, one thing is certain\u2014when a Ryzark is erased, it is <strong>gone forever</strong>.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3490080?t=1742036058","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/8090c3410059b99b872207205852ea9eec41c57b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742036058","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/85be271601f6a033f223ecc2777f9471e2fc3106/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742036058","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/85be271601f6a033f223ecc2777f9471e2fc3106/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742036058","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3584270,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/extras/Iron_Rift.png?t=1742036058\" />The world was never the same after the Rift. One night, an explosion of unknown energy tore through reality, unleashing terrifying and powerful creatures into the world which are now called <strong>Ryzarks</strong>. Cities fell, chaos reigned, and humanity struggled to survive. To fight back, scientists developed Riftguns, weapons capable of capturing and digitizing these creatures for control. While some used them to restore balance, others saw an opportunity for power.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Among the lawless survivors is Lenz, a battle-hardened fighter with nothing to lose. Once a street criminal, now a survivor in a world ruled by monsters and warlords, Lenz doesn\u2019t care about justice\u2014only survival. But after he crosses paths with one of the unknown creatures and forms an uneasy alliance, he\u2019s dragged into a brutal war against the Ruthless 8\u2014a group of warlords who control powerful creatures and rule their territories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/extras/Action_Combat.png?t=1742036058\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control in adrenaline-pumping real-time battles! Call your Ryzark, unleash powerful abilities, and execute dynamic moves in the heat of action. With a perfect blend of strategy and skill, every encounter is a fierce test of your reflexes and tactics. Get ready for the thrill of non-stop action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/extras/Iron_Rift_Real_Time_Combat_1_GIF.gif?t=1742036058\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/extras/Iron_Rift_Real_Time_Combat_2_GIF.gif?t=1742036058\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/extras/World.png?t=1742036058\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/extras/Iron_Rift_World_1_GIF.gif?t=1742036058\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/extras/Iron_Rift_World_2_GIF.gif?t=1742036058\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two years ago, the world changed forever. A blinding rift tore through reality, unleashing powerful and violent creatures known as <strong>Ryzarks, </strong>bringing destruction wherever they roamed. Humanity had no choice but to adapt. Specialized <strong>Riftguns</strong> were developed to weaken and digitize Ryzark. While meant for survival and balance, this technology soon fell into the wrong hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Criminals hidden in the underground started gaining even more power by using Ryzarks to establish brutal territories. The most feared among them became known as the <strong>Ruthless 8</strong>, a group with deep connections and overwhelming strength, nearly untouchable even by the government.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lenz, a lone drifter hardened by a life of loss and violence, never cared for the world's problems\u2014until the chaos became personal. Now, with nothing left to lose, he steps into the fight. Whether for survival, revenge, or something more, one thing is certain: <strong>only those who master the Rift will control the future.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/extras/Equipment.png?t=1742036058\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/extras/Riftgun.png?t=1742036058\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Riftguns</strong> aren\u2019t traditional weapons; they won\u2019t kill a Ryzark. Instead, they\u2019re designed to <strong>weaken and digitize</strong> them, making it possible to store them for later use. Different classes of Riftguns exist, from basic models barely strong enough to subdue a wild Ryzark to high-powered versions capable of handling the most dangerous creatures. But no matter how strong your gun is, <strong>you won\u2019t truly defeat a Ryzark until you battle it with one of your own!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/extras/Iron_Rift_Riftgun_1_GIF.gif?t=1742036058\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/extras/Iron_Rift_Riftgun_2_GIF.gif?t=1742036058\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/extras/Arkvice.png?t=1742036058\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once digitized, a Ryzark is stored in the <strong>Arkvice</strong>, a high-tech device that lets you <strong>manage, call, and upgrade</strong> your creatures. The Arkvice tracks their stats, strengths, and weaknesses, and even allows for enhancements to make them stronger in battle.<br><br>The Rift changed the world\u2014now it\u2019s time to take control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/extras/Iron_Rift_Arkvice_1_GIF.gif?t=1742036058\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/extras/Iron_Rift_Arkvice_2_GIF.gif?t=1742036058\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/extras/Erase_System.png?t=1742036058\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When a Ryzark takes too much damage in battle, the creature's essence begins to fragment, breaking apart at a molecular level. This irreversible process is known as <strong>Erasure</strong>, and once it begins, there is no saving the Ryzark. Unlike digitization, which preserves and stores a Ryzark's form, Erasure destroys it, wiping its existence from reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some believe the Erase System is a natural safeguard, preventing the world from being overrun by Ryzarks. Others whisper that it's a side effect of the rift energy that brought them into existence. Whatever the truth, one thing is certain\u2014when a Ryzark is erased, it is <strong>gone forever</strong>.\u00a0</p>","developers":["Infinity Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/134a0260f35364cb310b82a9aa1c2b9dec9b8411/header.jpg?t=1742036058","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257111084,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111084/movie480.mp4?t=1741714099","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111084/movie_max.mp4?t=1741714099"},"name":"Iron Rift","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257111084/0eb0708280a95f185097439e2ff9c9b3bf1635e1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741714099","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111084/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741714099","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111084/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741714099"}}],"name":"Iron Rift","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-3570K 3.4 GHz 4 Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050 (2GB)<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Infinity Studio"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia\nAtos criminosos","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/3fa80613449b886e02ef32b104a979af6efc1da2/ss_3fa80613449b886e02ef32b104a979af6efc1da2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1742036058","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490080/3fa80613449b886e02ef32b104a979af6efc1da2/ss_3fa80613449b886e02ef32b104a979af6efc1da2.600x338.jpg?t=1742036058"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://sha